<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA rating to Alberta's 30 bln yen bond.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA rating to Alberta's 30 bln yen bond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Monday it had assigned an AA rating to the Canadian province of Alberta's 30 billion yen 5.2 percent yen/Australian dollar dual-currency bond due on November 29, 1999.</p>
<p>The outlook for the rating was stable, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
</text>
